29:52.759 --> 29:54.630
I appreciate you gentlemen
stopping by.

29:54.766 --> 29:56.393
Shows respect.

29:56.529 --> 29:58.729
-Our pleasure, Joe.
-Yeah.

30:08.944 --> 30:10.675
