30:11.486 --> 30:13.150
(door closes)

30:14.685 --> 30:17.787
MICHAEL: I'm so excited
to start
recording with Q tonight.

30:17.922 --> 30:19.620
I wish you could come.

30:19.756 --> 30:22.351
I'm a little nervous,
but more excited. (chuckles)

30:22.487 --> 30:24.192
Definitely more excited.

30:24.328 --> 30:26.355
I just have all
these ideas in my head

30:26.491 --> 30:28.601
just constantly flowing.

30:28.736 --> 30:30.662
I just got to get them out.

30:31.296 --> 30:32.972
You know?

30:36.502 --> 30:38.377
You get some sleep, Louie.

30:38.512 --> 30:41.442
I'll be back in the morning.
I'll tell you all about it.

30:43.375 --> 30:44.742
(llama grunts)

30:50.285 --> 30:52.524
Are you ready, Joker? Yeah.

30:52.659 --> 30:54.059
Let's hit it.

30:55.757 --> 30:58.259
-You want me to drive?
-Not this time, Joker.

30:58.395 --> 31:00.362
-You sure about that?
-Next time.

31:00.498 --> 31:03.431
-I'd rather let Louie drive.
-(laughs)

31:06.831 --> 31:08.737
QUINCY:
 Well, take your time.

31:08.873 --> 31:10.000
 Settle in.

31:10.136 --> 31:12.242
No rush.

31:12.876 --> 31:14.407
And, uh...

31:14.543 --> 31:17.445
-keep these feet still.
-(chuckling)

31:21.019 --> 31:22.921
Oh, Q. Can you do me a favor

31:23.057 --> 31:24.952
and lower the lights
for me, please?

31:25.087 --> 31:26.423
Just a little bit.

31:26.559 --> 31:27.994
Thanks.

31:33.297 --> 31:35.391
(quietly):
You are confident.

31:35.526 --> 31:37.267
You're strong.

31:38.001 --> 31:39.729
You are beautiful.

31:39.865 --> 31:42.673
You are the greatest
of all time.

31:42.808 --> 31:44.835
(breathes deeply)

31:45.909 --> 31:47.244
(inhales)

31:50.111 --> 31:51.876
(exhaling)

31:52.011 --> 31:54.482
QUINCY (over headphones):
Michael, you ready?

31:58.919 --> 32:01.291
