35:16.491 --> 35:18.785
Well, is it a car? Did you get
a damn Ferrari, Mike?

35:18.921 --> 35:21.385
-Mike, I'm going back to bed.
-Marlon, Tito,

35:21.520 --> 35:23.021
-don't wake your father up.
-♪ All the little birds ♪

35:23.156 --> 35:24.826
