01:10:30.092 --> 01:10:32.362
You're singing on every song.

01:10:32.498 --> 01:10:33.695
A little more.

01:10:33.831 --> 01:10:36.036
Don't kid a kidder now.

01:10:36.171 --> 01:10:38.643
(drumming)

01:10:38.778 --> 01:10:40.678
