01:10:58.897 --> 01:11:01.156
♪ ♪

01:11:05.468 --> 01:11:06.631
Now that's rock and roll.

01:11:06.766 --> 01:11:08.596
That's some Van Halen shit.

01:11:08.731 --> 01:11:11.339
-♪ Beat it, beat it ♪
-♪ Beat it, beat it ♪

01:11:11.474 --> 01:11:14.677
♪ No one wants to be defeated ♪

01:11:14.813 --> 01:11:18.148
♪ Showin' how funky
and strong is your fight ♪

01:11:18.283 --> 01:11:19.842
♪ It doesn't matter ♪

01:11:19.977 --> 01:11:21.518
♪ Who's wrong or right ♪

01:11:21.653 --> 01:11:23.515
-♪ Just beat it ♪
-♪ Beat it... ♪

01:11:23.651 --> 01:11:24.914
Not you, my Marie Antoinette,

01:11:25.050 --> 01:11:27.250
for I will give you
eternal life.

01:11:27.385 --> 01:11:30.361
-("Beat It" fades)
 -(dramatic music plays on TV)

01:11:33.990 --> 01:11:36.290
(dramatic music continues)

01:11:53.008 --> 01:11:54.710
 (thunder crashing)

01:11:54.846 --> 01:11:57.751
 (sinister laughter)

01:12:05.031 --> 01:12:07.530
