01:12:11.233 --> 01:12:12.903
(gasping softly)

01:12:13.039 --> 01:12:15.703
("Thriller" playing)

01:12:22.377 --> 01:12:24.247
Can we stop a sec?

01:12:24.382 --> 01:12:26.340
-Cut! Cut!
-(music stops)

01:12:26.475 --> 01:12:28.044
MICHAEL: That was great.
You guys were perfect.

01:12:28.180 --> 01:12:31.048
Just keep warm.
Stretch out for a second.

01:12:32.621 --> 01:12:34.151
ASSISTANT DIRECTOR:
Hey.

01:12:34.286 --> 01:12:36.851
