01:12:44.570 --> 01:12:46.469
You know,
Fred Astaire would always say,

01:12:46.604 --> 01:12:48.298
"You've got to get
the whole body."

01:12:48.434 --> 01:12:50.107
You know, that's how
the audience feels the dance.

01:12:50.242 --> 01:12:52.775
-Right, right.
-Um...

01:12:53.545 --> 01:12:55.369
Can you ask John
just to try that?

01:12:55.504 --> 01:12:56.981
-Just for one take?
-Yeah, you got it. Yeah.

01:12:57.116 --> 01:12:58.482
-Thank you.
-Yeah.

01:13:02.749 --> 01:13:04.280
So, instead of moving in,

01:13:04.415 --> 01:13:06.248
