head to toe, okay?

01:13:12.397 --> 01:13:13.462
-Perfect.
-All right.

01:13:13.597 --> 01:13:15.056
-Thank you.
-Okay, everybody,

01:13:15.191 --> 01:13:17.435
back to
first positions, please!

01:13:18.670 --> 01:13:20.633
