01:14:10.420 --> 01:14:12.380
(breathing rhythmically)

01:14:27.840 --> 01:14:32.200
♪ 'Cause this is thriller,
thriller night ♪

01:14:32.335 --> 01:14:34.435
♪ And no one's gonna save you ♪

01:14:34.570 --> 01:14:36.472
♪ From the beast
about to strike ♪

01:14:36.608 --> 01:14:40.210
♪ You know it's thriller,
thriller night ♪

01:14:40.345 --> 01:14:42.110
♪ You're fighting
for your life ♪

01:14:42.246 --> 01:14:44.684
♪ Inside a killer, thriller ♪

01:14:44.819 --> 01:14:49.019
♪ Thriller, thriller night ♪

01:14:49.155 --> 01:14:50.825
♪ 'Cause I can
thrill you more ♪

01:14:50.961 --> 01:14:53.356
♪ Than any ghoul
would ever dare try ♪

01:14:53.491 --> 01:14:55.529
-♪ Thriller ♪
-♪ Ooh-ooh ♪

01:14:55.665 --> 01:14:57.162
♪ Thriller night ♪

01:14:57.297 --> 01:14:59.198
♪ So let me hold you tight
