stars all the way to the top.

01:23:50.067 --> 01:23:51.595
-Yeah, you are. (laughs)
-Yeah.

01:23:51.731 --> 01:23:54.761
-Life is good, my friend.
-Yes, it is.

01:23:54.896 --> 01:23:56.370
-(both laughing)
-Yes, it is.

01:23:56.506 --> 01:23:58.435
Those Cubans,
straight from Castro himself.

01:23:58.570 --> 01:23:59.668
-All right. (sniffs)
-Yes.

01:23:59.803 --> 01:24:02.335
-Yes, yes, yes, yes.
-Oh, yes.

