01:24:54.959 --> 01:24:56.793
-I watch you like a hawk.
-Hmm. (chuckles)

01:24:56.928 --> 01:24:59.334
I love the way
you promote your fighters.

01:24:59.469 --> 01:25:01.336
-Uh-huh.
-You're the king of marketing.

01:25:01.471 --> 01:25:04.073
You know, I just, uh,
I think that you and I,

01:25:04.209 --> 01:25:06.341
