we could, uh...

01:25:07.542 --> 01:25:09.073
...we could form
a good partnership.

01:25:09.208 --> 01:25:10.572
Me and you?

01:25:10.708 --> 01:25:12.543
I'll cut you a good deal.

01:25:12.679 --> 01:25:15.515
-I like deals.
-(sets down lighter)

01:25:21.451 --> 01:25:23.154
I need...

01:25:23.289 --> 01:25:24.887
this for my boys.

01:25:25.521 --> 01:25:26.988
I need it.

01:25:27.123 --> 01:25:29.459
You know, I-I think
they deserve the-the...

01:25:29.594 --> 01:25:31.057
Rolls-Royce of sponsorships.

01:25:31.193 --> 01:25:34.234
I mean, merchandising,
marketing, you hear me?

01:25:34.369 --> 01:25:35.630
I mean, it's got to be huge.

01:25:35.765 --> 01:25:38.670
And only you and I could do it.

01:25:39.505 --> 01:25:41.406
It'll be called...

01:25:41.541 --> 01:25:44.504
-the Victory tour.
-Hmm.

01:25:44.640 --> 01:25:46.473
(sucks teeth)

01:25:46.608 --> 01:25:48.313
(clicks tongue)

01:25:48.449 --> 01:25:50.212
I may have something for you.

01:25:50.347 --> 01:25:51.714
