01:27:33.618 --> 01:27:35.457
Who would have thought?

01:27:36.257 --> 01:27:38.662
Me. I thought.

01:27:38.797 --> 01:27:40.825
(chuckles)

01:27:44.000 --> 01:27:45.698
Come here.

01:27:46.766 --> 01:27:48.932
